"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"[General] SDK 1.67 adds five abstract type-predicate methods to `DeclarativeConfigProperties`, but this update only adapts the two bridge implementations. `SpringDeclarativeConfigProperties` and `SemconvStabilityTest.TestDeclarativeConfigProperties` still implement the interface without `isString`, `isBoolean`, `isInt`, `isLong`, and `isDouble`, so their modules no longer compile against this version. Please update both remaining implementations (and cover the Spring adapter\u2019s coercion behavior) as part of the version bump.","comment_commit_id":"94bc36c1966e5d76d9db0badb2bf86d7188fab1d","comment_id":4232044407,"key":"inline:4232044407","kind":"inline","line":8,"original_commit_id":"1300ca6fe15729f7047def008ed465c1edb23009","original_line":8,"path":"dependencyManagement/build.gradle.kts","review_commit_id":"1300ca6fe15729f7047def008ed465c1edb23009","review_id":5472421560,"review_submitted_at":"2026-10-09T15:58:39Z","root_author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"thread_context":[{"author":{"id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","type":"Bot"},"body_hash":"9617988d99760f731f77b69c2818e7bf704bd17fc3e634cf56b831fd1fe70cec","id":4232044407,"parent":null,"updated_at":"2026-10-09T15:58:39Z"}],"thread_id":"PRRT_kwDODJKVX86q2inq"},{"body":"[Javaagent] The 1.67 `TextMapGetter.getAll` method is not forwarded by this adapter. `AgentGetter` therefore inherits the default implementation that derives one value from `get`; if an application getter exposes repeated `baggage` or `tracestate` headers through `getAll`, the agent propagator sees only one and loses propagation data. Add a 1.67-aware adapter that delegates `getAll`, while retaining the legacy path for older application APIs.","comment_commit_id":"94bc36c1966e5d76d9db0badb2bf86d7188fab1d","comment_id":4243844966,"key":"inline:4243844966","kind":"inline","line":63,"original_commit_id":"1c29becf2aa34